	(text "HSE: X32258MOB4SI 8 MHz, C_L = 12 pF. C1 = C2 = 2*(C_L - C_stray) = 2*(12 pF - 4 pF) = 16 pF -> 15 pF C0G.\nLSE (DNP): Q13FC13500049 32.768 kHz, C_L = 6 pF -> 2*(6 pF - 4 pF) = 4 pF -> 4.7 pF C0G. C_stray ~ 3-5 pF, verify on bring-up.\nUSB: 0R series resistors (replace with 22R if needed). 1.5k D+ pull-up to 3V3 (F103 has no internal pull-up).\nVBAT tied to 3V3 via solder jumper (cut to run VBAT from a coin cell on the header pin).\nUser LED on PC13 is low-active (~1.3 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
